      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Overview",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "TestFlight allows you to distribute your apps to beta testers before releasing your apps on the App Store. You can learn more about TestFlight on the `https://developer.apple.com/testflight/`.",
          "refs": [
            "https://developer.apple.com/testflight/"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Using the App Store Connect API, you can automate the same tasks you perform in the TestFlight section of App Store Connect; for example:",
